# Glossy UI Without Gradients

- Do not add gradient colors or gradient utilities in this project UI.
- Avoid Tailwind classes and CSS functions such as `bg-gradient-*`, `bg-linear-*`, `radial-gradient`, `linear-gradient`, `conic-gradient`, `from-*`, `via-*`, and `to-*`.
- Build polished glossy surfaces with solid or translucent theme colors, borders, blur, layered shadows, subtle highlights, and existing design tokens.
- If a gradient already exists in untouched legacy code, do not expand it. Prefer replacing it when editing that area.
